title: "Air-Quality Toolkit (Sentinel-5P and MODIS MAIAC)"
abstract: "Google Earth Engine script that extracts monthly NO2, SO2, CO, O3, HCHO (Sentinel-5P) and aerosol optical depth (MODIS MAIAC) for a region and monitoring stations into one long-format table."
